  "description": "You pay something to get something. This is the common sense of people living in modern times. But what if you are asked to pay for the rights you take for granted? What if you had to twist the arm of the person sitting next to you to gain the right to breathe? In order to get something, you 'must' 'offer' something. Welcome to a world where laws and order rule.\n\n(Source: Lezhin, translated)",
